{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Friends is a cozy multiplayer sandbox where players explore a vibrant world, catch fish, play instruments, and uncover secrets with friends or on their own. Complete a rich compendium filled with animals, vehicles, fish, and locations to discover. From riding cows to paddling along beaches, playing music around a campfire, chilling in a nightclub or a yacht, it's a blend of chill vibes and discovery. The real treasures are the Fireside Friends made along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-BE YOURSELF-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/ezgif-1303a8e2e75a37.gif?t=1748953459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the character customizer to dress your avatar just the way you like it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-RIDE LIKE THE WIND-</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/ezgif-1a5268413978eb.gif?t=1748953459\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world in rideable animals, cars, bikes, or take a hike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-SAIL AWAY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/ezgif-163d6ab0259517.gif?t=1748953459\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy water sports like Paddleboarding, or go on a rowboat trip while fishing or playing some music.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681060?t=1748953459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681060?t=1748953459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/a8eb97a055a7a0a4c50160fcd75abb1436b55668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748953459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai